rface":"硃伺","start":529,"end":531,"person_id":"zx9_13u_h08","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p006:m0544","surface":"張奕","start":544,"end":546,"person_id":"9u8_20z_zdq","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p006:m0601","surface":"硃伺","start":601,"end":603,"person_id":"zx9_13u_h08","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p006:m0611","surface":"張奕","start":611,"end":613,"person_id":"9u8_20z_zdq","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p006:m0623","surface":"王敦","start":623,"end":625,"person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan","book_id":"b-jinshu-066","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-066-taokan-ws1527632"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-taokan:p009","text":"王敦深忌侃功。將還江陵，欲詣敦別，皇甫方回及硃伺等諫，以為不可。侃不從。敦果留侃不遣，左轉廣州刺史、平越中郎將，以王廣為荊州。侃之佐吏將士詣敦請留侃。敦怒，不許。侃將鄭攀、蘇溫、馬俊等不欲南行，遂西迎杜曾以距暠。敦意攀承侃風旨，被甲持矛，將殺侃，出而復回者數四。侃正色曰：「使君之雄斷，當裁天下，何此不決乎！」因起如廁。諮議參軍梅陶、長史陳頒言於敦曰：「周訪與侃親姻，如左右手，安有斷人左手而右手不應者乎！」敦意遂解，於是設盛饌以餞之。侃便夜發。敦引其子瞻參軍。侃既達豫章，見周訪，流涕曰：「非卿外援，我殆不免！」侃因進至始興。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":45,"last_line":45,"raw_start":5296,"raw_end":5562,"raw_character_offsets":[5298,5299,5300,5301,5302,5303,5304,5305,5306,5307,5308,5309,5310,5311,5312,5313,5314,5315,5316,5317,5318,5319,5320,5321,5322,5323,5324,5325,5326,5327,5328,5329,5330,5331,5332,5333,5334,5335,5336,5337,5338,5339,5340,5341,5342,5343,5344,5345,5346,5347,5348,5349,5350,5351,5352,5353,5354,5355,5356,5357,5358,5359,5360,5361,5362,5363,5364,5365,5366,5367,5368,5369,5370,5371,5372,5373,5374,5375,5376,5377,5378,5379,5380,5381,5382,5383,5384,5385,5386,5387,5388,5389,5390,5391,5392,5393,5394,5395,5396,5397,5398,5399,5400,5401,5402,5403,5404,5405,5406,5407,5408,5409,5410,5411,5412,5413,5414,5415,5416,5417,5418,5419,5420,5421,5422,5423,5424,5425,5426,5427,5428,5429,5430,5431,543